{
  "_comment": [
    "Paste into ~/.codex/hooks.json (CODEX_HOME/hooks.json). Codex reads hooks",
    "from their own file, not from config.toml.",
    "",
    "This runs the SAME script as the Claude Code adapter. Codex 0.153.3 embeds",
    "JSON Schemas for its hook payloads - pre-tool-use.command.input,",
    "post-tool-use.command.input, subagent-start/stop, session-start/end, stop,",
    "user-prompt-submit - and their fields are the ones Claude Code sends, plus",
    "`turn_id` and a required `model`. Verified by extracting the schemas from",
    "the shipped binary; see docs/cloud/external-agents.md.",
    "",
    "Set GT_CLOUD_AGENT_KIND=codex in the environment so the card is labelled",
    "as Codex rather than Claude Code, alongside GT_CLOUD_ORIGIN,",
    "GT_CLOUD_SESSION and GT_CLOUD_TOKEN.",
    "",
    "Codex names its tools differently from Claude Code (`exec`, `apply_patch`,",
    "`shell_command`), which is why every matcher here is \"*\": the adapter reads",
    "the payload's fields, not the tool's name. If you would rather not rely on",
    "hooks at all, run cloud/adapters/codex/gt_cloud_codex.py instead - it reads",
    "the session rollout file and needs no configuration in Codex."
  ],
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python \"C:/path/to/gt-cloud/cloud/adapters/claude_code/gt_cloud_hook.py\""
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "UserPromptSubmit": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python \"C:/path/to/gt-cloud/cloud/adapters/claude_code/gt_cloud_hook.py\""
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python \"C:/path/to/gt-cloud/cloud/adapters/claude_code/gt_cloud_hook.py\""
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python \"C:/path/to/gt-cloud/cloud/adapters/claude_code/gt_cloud_hook.py\""
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SubagentStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python \"C:/path/to/gt-cloud/cloud/adapters/claude_code/gt_cloud_hook.py\""
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SubagentStop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python \"C:/path/to/gt-cloud/cloud/adapters/claude_code/gt_cloud_hook.py\""
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python \"C:/path/to/gt-cloud/cloud/adapters/claude_code/gt_cloud_hook.py\""
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SessionEnd": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python \"C:/path/to/gt-cloud/cloud/adapters/claude_code/gt_cloud_hook.py\""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
